                <p>Outside of school, I'm always looking for the next thing to explore. I traveled through four countries in Europe last summer, Croatia was my favorite by far, and at home I'm the person popping into random shops just to see how they've thought about the space and the interior design. I'll consume pretty much any kind of media I can get my hands on. I'm a sophomore at USC in Los Angeles, super excited about the future.</p>
